@HYSMe.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7001
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..YP8Am_5ksbKwo67D5vKpVLRFD8ndZqtInL6cXa_-Xj8

### Get all pets
GET {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Accept: application/json

###

### Get pet by id
GET {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Query pets (pagination + filters)
GET {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets/query?PageNumber=1&ItemPerPage=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Query pets by status (example LOST = 0, FOUND = 1 — adjust if needed)
GET {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets/query?Statuses=0&PageNumber=1&ItemPerPage=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get pets in area
GET {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets/area?North=57.0&South=56.0&East=25.0&West=24.0
Accept: application/json

###

### Create new pet (requires auth!)
POST {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Max",
  "type": "Dog",
  "breed": "Labrador",
  "color": "Black",
  "description": "Very friendly",
  "latitude": 56.95,
  "longitude": 24.10,
  "dateLost": "2026-04-01T10:00:00",
  "lastSeenAddress": "Riga center",
  "status": 0,
  "imageUrl": null
}

###

### Update pet (requires auth + owner)
PUT {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets/15
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Max Updated",
  "type": "Dog",
  "breed": "Labrador",
  "color": "Black",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "latitude": 56.95,
  "longitude": 24.10,
  "dateLost": "2026-04-01T10:00:00",
  "lastSeenAddress": "Riga center",
  "status": 0,
  "imageUrl": null
}

###

### Delete pet (ADMIN only)
DELETE {{HYSMe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pets/15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###